Package: aivas
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         python3 (>= 3.10),
         python3-pip,
         nmap
Description: AI-Assisted Network Vulnerability Assessment System
 AIVAS scans network targets using Nmap, correlates findings against a local
 offline CVE database, and generates bilingual (English/Swahili) vulnerability
 reports narrated by an LLM.
 .
 Features a Textual-based terminal UI and a FastAPI + React web UI. Supports
 Groq cloud inference, Mistral, and local Ollama for fully offline operation.
